Package: view-md
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6
Maintainer: Michael Tutty <mtutty@gforgegroup.com>
Description: Fast, lightweight native Markdown viewer
 view-md is a self-contained, NativeAOT-compiled Markdown viewer built for
 instant startup as the default handler for .md files. Renders Markdown
 natively (no webview/Electron dependency), keeps a most-recently-used
 list, and can browse a whole directory of Markdown files via a sidebar
 tree.
